00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:24.918 line:92%
It was called the Gauntlet

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:30.990
We did 8 ep-- wait, or was i
10 episodes of 8 weeks, right?

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.026 size:81% position:41%
