you're part of history.

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:03.490 size:84% position:42% line:92%
But still, ooh! No, no.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.693
-Yeah. I mean, the fact that
they did six Saturdays in a row,

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:07.494 line:92%
