00:02:07.494 --> 00:02:10.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I really do think they did
an incredible job.

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:11.664 line:92%
-And you were a hero, Seth

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:14.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
You really --
I mean, listen to me.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
You deserve -- Emmys should be
raining down on you

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
for the work you did on that
-Oh, please stop.

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:19.739 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I mean, come on.

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:23.009 size:78% position:39%
-We talk a lot about
Second Chance Theater

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:26.312
with my old cohorts of the show.
-Yes.

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:29.048 line:92%
-What are some of your worst

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:33.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
most delicious bombs
under the bleachers with Lorne

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:34.687 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my God.

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:37.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's almost
too many to count.

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:42.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What was Chicken McNugs?
-Well, Chicken McNugs was --

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:45.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, it was --
Matt Dillon was the host.

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:50.370
And he was sort of a hot sho
boyfriend to Rachel Dratch

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
who was sort of playing
like a little --

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:55.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, a girl
with lots of cats

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:57.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
and scented candles
who couldn't get a boyfriend

00:02:57.443 --> 00:03:01.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
So he broke up with her
in a miserable way.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:04.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
So then she just hauls it
to McDonald's

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:08.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
and buys 500,000 chicken
McNuggets,

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:12.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
all sauces, and it became
a musical, alright?

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:15.328 line:92%
I've never seen Lorne so angry

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:18.698 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:21.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said -- it was just --
it's so -- you know,

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:24.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
it was one of those things
where he was so upset.

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:26.406 line:92%
And by the way, I was upset too.

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:27.941 line:92%
I don't -- I don't blame Lorne

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:33.346
But he did throw -- he threw
the headsets on the floor.

00:03:33.346 --> 00:03:34.981 line:92%
Again, I don't blame him.

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:38.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I was like,
"Okay, I'm out."

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:40.820 line:92%
I walked to the elevators.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
First I walked up
to Maya's office,

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:48.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
