00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:56.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I went back up,
and he apologized.

00:03:56.436 --> 00:03:57.604 line:92%
But still, I felt terrible

00:03:57.604 --> 00:03:59.672 line:92%
The whole thing was a disaster

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:01.774 size:75% position:38% line:92%
But -- I don't know.

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:06.279
That is -- that was the wors
day. It's a really sad story

00:04:06.279 --> 00:04:07.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
Happy birthday, Lorne,
by the way.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
I hope you had a good birthday
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:11.751 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-It should be noted.

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:15.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, it is --
it is intensely stressful

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:17.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
to be underneath
the bleachers with Lorne.

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:18.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
-You mentioned the headset

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:19.459 size:84% position:42% line:92%
He is wearing a headset

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:21.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
that is plugged
directly into the monitor.

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:22.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-So that he can get --

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:25.498
he can just like mainline
the sketch into his ears.

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:29.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, so he's hearing it
and I'm kind of not hearing it

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:33.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, and so -- and then David
McWilson was another sketc

00:04:33.906 --> 00:04:38.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
where Rachel Dratch
played a little boy,

00:04:38.344 --> 00:04:42.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Lorne, it was --
she played a child actor,

00:04:42.515 --> 00:04:45.518 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and it was real quiet.

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:47.320 size:81% position:41%
And Lorne turned to me
in the middle of it,

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he was like,
"This is almost Brechtian"

00:04:49.222 --> 00:04:51.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
in a withering way,
and I was like,

00:04:51.024 --> 00:04:53.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
