what that means,

00:04:53.026 --> 00:04:54.961 line:92%
but I know it's not good."

00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:57.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I know Brecht.
But anyway.

00:04:57.096 --> 00:05:00.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
So there was just a lot of -
Ooh, so many --

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:04.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
so many hot farts
under that bleachers,

00:05:04.203 --> 00:05:06.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause the nerves,
it was terrible.

00:05:06.606 --> 00:05:10.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I should note,
lest anybody should doubt,

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:12.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you also had monster hits
in your time on the show.

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:15.948
-Oh, Seth, you're so sweet
-You and Maya were friends

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:16.949 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
at The Groundlings.

00:05:16.949 --> 00:05:20.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
You wrote Donatella Versace.
-Oh, God.

00:05:20.119 --> 00:05:24.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mentioned to you
I ran into her recently.

00:05:24.691 --> 00:05:25.458 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And I only sort of --

00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:28.561
I had no awareness of her
