00:05:30.797 --> 00:05:32.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
She enjoyed it.
-She did.

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:34.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
She had a very good
sense of humor.

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:35.401 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You know, as --

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:38.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think Europeans have bette
sense of humors

00:05:38.871 --> 00:05:39.939 line:92%
about themselves, you know

00:05:39.939 --> 00:05:44.277
Like, she thought it was
very funny and adored Maya

00:05:44.277 --> 00:05:47.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
