00:05:57.423 --> 00:05:58.424 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He is so cute.

00:05:58.424 --> 00:06:02.562
-You -- One thing that I kno
you've used some of your writing

00:06:02.562 --> 00:06:04.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
for and some
