00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:04.957 line:92%
Like, it was just stupid.

00:07:04.957 --> 00:07:09.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Rowe went on and read
all these crazy lines

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:12.598 size:81% position:41% line:92%
