00:08:52.965 --> 00:08:53.699 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And his hair was soak--

00:08:53.699 --> 00:08:56.702
you know, that beautiful
head of hair, soaking wet.

00:08:56.702 --> 00:08:57.136 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
